1
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:36,920
If today's show was put on for me,

2
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:39,020
then my reaction

3
00:00:39,140 --> 00:00:41,870
might make Shen Tianbai think
he has already won.

4
00:00:42,930 --> 00:00:44,930
When someone gets close to success,

5
00:00:44,930 --> 00:00:46,660
they're most likely to slip up.

6
00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:48,640
I see.

7
00:00:49,350 --> 00:00:51,410
If Shen Tianbai is faking his amnesia

8
00:00:51,570 --> 00:00:53,610
and infiltrated the Qingtian Gang
with ulterior motives,

9
00:00:53,610 --> 00:00:55,080
he'll definitely take advantage
of the opportunity tonight

10
00:00:55,080 --> 00:00:56,680
and take a look at the ledger.

11
00:00:57,920 --> 00:01:00,120
Then we'll expose him right to his face.

12
00:01:02,130 --> 00:01:03,010
Uncle Zhong,

13
00:01:03,410 --> 00:01:05,040
give me the key to the warehouse.

14
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:06,900
I will deliver the ledger myself.

15
00:01:07,610 --> 00:01:08,270
Yes.

16
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:20,670
[Eclipse in the Lost City]
[Episode 4]

17
00:01:24,230 --> 00:01:25,110
Young Master.

18
00:01:26,210 --> 00:01:26,870
Don't move.

19
00:01:27,410 --> 00:01:28,470
You are injured.

20
00:01:28,830 --> 00:01:29,789
Just lie down.

21
00:01:32,380 --> 00:01:33,440
Does it still hurt?

22
00:01:33,860 --> 00:01:34,820
No.

23
00:01:34,860 --> 00:01:35,780
Liar.

24
00:01:36,539 --> 00:01:37,940
You've got so many injuries.

25
00:01:37,940 --> 00:01:39,270
You're not made of iron.

26
00:01:39,340 --> 00:01:40,539
How could it not hurt?

27
00:01:41,100 --> 00:01:42,100
Actually...

28
00:01:43,620 --> 00:01:45,280
I've remembered a few things.

29
00:01:46,259 --> 00:01:47,180
What?

30
00:01:47,180 --> 00:01:48,250
Some things

31
00:01:48,979 --> 00:01:50,500
from school.

32
00:01:52,340 --> 00:01:53,140
Young Master,

33
00:01:54,180 --> 00:01:57,780
did we know each other a long time ago?

34
00:02:00,340 --> 00:02:01,500
Who at school

35
00:02:02,060 --> 00:02:03,460
didn't know you?

36
00:02:05,700 --> 00:02:07,060
Then were we friends?

37
00:02:11,940 --> 00:02:12,740
No.

38
00:02:13,620 --> 00:02:14,880
We were never friends.

39
00:02:15,460 --> 00:02:16,260
Lu Ye,

40
00:02:16,820 --> 00:02:18,860
you won't even lie to me?

41
00:02:24,460 --> 00:02:26,140
Uncle Zhong made this calming soup.

42
00:02:26,140 --> 00:02:26,940
Here you go.

43
00:02:27,150 --> 00:02:28,550
Drink it while it's warm.

44
00:02:35,740 --> 00:02:36,540
Young Master.

45
00:02:38,060 --> 00:02:40,060
You should go back and get some rest.

46
00:02:40,100 --> 00:02:41,060
I can't rest.

47
00:02:41,380 --> 00:02:43,310
I still have to put the ledger away.

48
00:02:45,220 --> 00:02:46,220
Do you know

49
00:02:47,420 --> 00:02:49,300
why I have to get this?

50
00:02:53,220 --> 00:02:54,350
I'm not telling you.

51
00:02:56,500 --> 00:02:57,120
Alright.

52
00:02:58,700 --> 00:02:59,540
I'm off.

53
00:03:06,540 --> 00:03:07,340
Shen Tianbai.

54
00:03:08,380 --> 00:03:09,180
Sweet dreams.

55
00:03:10,820 --> 00:03:11,620
You too.

56
00:03:39,300 --> 00:03:40,340
Young Master.

57
00:03:40,530 --> 00:03:41,450
The light is on.

58
00:03:41,500 --> 00:03:43,220
Could it really be Shen Tianbai?

59
00:03:43,220 --> 00:03:43,900
Let's go.

60
00:03:46,579 --> 00:03:47,220
Shen Tianbai,

61
00:03:47,220 --> 00:03:47,740
you—

62
00:03:50,140 --> 00:03:51,100
The light...

63
00:04:03,820 --> 00:04:05,220
I'll wait here all night.

64
00:04:05,580 --> 00:04:06,940
I don't believe

65
00:04:07,300 --> 00:04:09,430
I can't wait you out, you little thief.

66
00:04:30,630 --> 00:04:34,510
[Lu Mansion]

67
00:04:56,500 --> 00:04:57,400
Young Master.

68
00:04:57,780 --> 00:04:59,040
Didn't you sleep well?

69
00:04:59,980 --> 00:05:01,420
You slept pretty well.

70
00:05:03,140 --> 00:05:06,070
Thanks to the calming soup
you brought me last night.

71
00:05:10,850 --> 00:05:13,780
[The night before]

72
00:05:14,980 --> 00:05:16,110
Something's wrong.

73
00:05:40,740 --> 00:05:42,220
Are you looking for this one?

74
00:05:42,220 --> 00:05:44,100
This looks like the second volume.

75
00:05:44,100 --> 00:05:45,630
Excuse me, coming through.

76
00:05:51,260 --> 00:05:52,180
Who is

77
00:05:52,180 --> 00:05:53,260
disturbing my sleep?

78
00:05:53,260 --> 00:05:53,700
You.

79
00:05:54,620 --> 00:05:55,220
You...

80
00:05:59,540 --> 00:06:00,460
So you are Lu Ye.

81
00:06:00,580 --> 00:06:01,500
Scared?

82
00:06:02,060 --> 00:06:03,460
My dad is Lu—

83
00:06:05,180 --> 00:06:06,940
Your dad asked me
to keep an eye on you at school.

84
00:06:06,940 --> 00:06:08,540
So come back to class with me.

85
00:06:10,300 --> 00:06:12,660
Shen Tianbai?

86
00:06:14,460 --> 00:06:17,790
You're the transfer student
my dad is always talking about.

87
00:06:18,220 --> 00:06:19,480
Your dad sponsored me.

88
00:06:19,660 --> 00:06:20,580
In return,

89
00:06:20,980 --> 00:06:22,600
I'm responsible
for looking after your studies.

90
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,400
Come with me.

91
00:06:36,140 --> 00:06:36,940
Mr. Shen.

92
00:06:37,740 --> 00:06:39,270
I've long heard that you are

93
00:06:39,659 --> 00:06:40,980
handsome, dashing,

94
00:06:41,010 --> 00:06:41,830
and brilliantly gifted.

95
00:06:41,830 --> 00:06:44,890
Seeing you today,
you truly live up to your reputation.

96
00:06:45,260 --> 00:06:46,620
Because it's the truth.

97
00:06:46,620 --> 00:06:47,220
So what?

98
00:06:47,380 --> 00:06:48,020
Oh no.

99
00:06:48,020 --> 00:06:50,340
I've finally met my match
when it comes to shamelessness.

100
00:06:50,340 --> 00:06:51,340
So,

101
00:06:51,420 --> 00:06:52,580
let's be friends.

102
00:06:52,700 --> 00:06:53,659
You just got here.

103
00:06:53,659 --> 00:06:56,340
There's nowhere in Ningcheng I don't know.

104
00:06:56,380 --> 00:06:57,580
I'll show you around.

105
00:06:59,580 --> 00:07:01,440
You want me to skip class with you?

106
00:07:01,700 --> 00:07:02,860
That's impossible.

107
00:07:03,460 --> 00:07:05,460
I genuinely want to be your friend.

108
00:07:09,460 --> 00:07:11,220
This chocolate is hard to come by.

109
00:07:11,220 --> 00:07:13,080
I wouldn't give it to just anyone.

110
00:07:14,900 --> 00:07:16,180
Who is this guy?

111
00:07:16,540 --> 00:07:17,660
He's so handsome.

112
00:07:18,820 --> 00:07:19,620
No need.

113
00:07:19,790 --> 00:07:20,920
I'm not interested.

114
00:07:21,220 --> 00:07:23,500
Shen Tianbai, you will regret this.

115
00:07:28,620 --> 00:07:29,150
Tianbai.

116
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:30,020
Bye.

117
00:07:35,930 --> 00:07:37,070
A flat tire?

118
00:07:57,390 --> 00:07:58,730
You almost

119
00:07:59,100 --> 00:08:00,340
caught me.

120
00:08:00,980 --> 00:08:01,780
Sweet dreams.

121
00:08:03,130 --> 00:08:04,020
You too.

122
00:08:08,340 --> 00:08:09,140
Lu Ye.

123
00:08:09,670 --> 00:08:10,930
After all these years,

124
00:08:11,940 --> 00:08:13,870
you really haven't changed at all.

125
00:08:17,140 --> 00:08:17,940
Young Master.

126
00:08:20,580 --> 00:08:22,380
The guests you invited are here.

127
00:08:23,820 --> 00:08:24,580
Really?

128
00:08:24,860 --> 00:08:25,990
Please show them in.

129
00:08:26,140 --> 00:08:26,780
Yes.

130
00:08:28,460 --> 00:08:29,920
I'll take you to meet them.

131
00:08:30,340 --> 00:08:33,620
They're all old friends of mine.

132
00:08:37,700 --> 00:08:38,620
Young Master.

133
00:08:39,700 --> 00:08:41,020
Enough with

134
00:08:41,020 --> 00:08:42,350
the childish tantrums.

135
00:08:42,900 --> 00:08:44,179
Hand over the ledger.

136
00:08:44,500 --> 00:08:45,900
Out of respect for the old chief,

137
00:08:44,820 --> 00:08:46,960
[Qinglong, Qingtian Gang]

138
00:08:45,940 --> 00:08:47,300
I'll let this one slide.

139
00:08:48,180 --> 00:08:48,990
What?

140
00:08:49,170 --> 00:08:51,580
Aren't we here today
to get the Qingtian Gang's token?

141
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:51,220
[Zhuque, Qingtian Gang]

142
00:08:53,300 --> 00:08:54,240
What's the rush?

143
00:08:54,580 --> 00:08:56,330
Qinglong, Zhuque.

144
00:08:56,580 --> 00:08:57,240
Take a seat.

145
00:09:01,220 --> 00:09:02,020
Serve the tea.

146
00:09:11,260 --> 00:09:12,260
Shen Tianbai?

147
00:09:16,420 --> 00:09:17,350
Why are you here?

148
00:09:17,540 --> 00:09:18,780
Weren't you missing?

149
00:09:18,780 --> 00:09:19,480
What?

150
00:09:19,620 --> 00:09:21,300
Was killing the old chief not enough?

151
00:09:21,300 --> 00:09:23,630
Are you not going
to spare his son, either?

152
00:09:24,420 --> 00:09:25,220
Alright.

153
00:09:25,900 --> 00:09:26,780
Come back.

154
00:09:30,420 --> 00:09:31,350
Lu Ye.

155
00:09:31,660 --> 00:09:32,780
You brat.

156
00:09:32,900 --> 00:09:33,820
Are you crazy?

157
00:09:34,100 --> 00:09:36,230
This is the man who killed your father!

158
00:09:36,530 --> 00:09:37,330
Qinglong.

159
00:09:38,340 --> 00:09:40,540
Who said you could speak
to Young Master like that?

160
00:09:40,540 --> 00:09:41,740
The old chief is gone,

161
00:09:41,940 --> 00:09:43,740
but I'm still alive.

162
00:09:45,220 --> 00:09:47,490
We don't even know for sure

163
00:09:47,940 --> 00:09:49,140
who killed my father.

164
00:09:50,220 --> 00:09:51,220
What do you mean?

165
00:09:51,820 --> 00:09:53,100
Baihu is dead.

166
00:09:53,460 --> 00:09:54,660
Xuanwu is by my side.

167
00:09:55,140 --> 00:09:57,380
Qinglong and Zhuque
have set up their own factions.

168
00:09:57,380 --> 00:09:58,980
I really can't figure it out.

169
00:10:00,020 --> 00:10:02,060
There's a mole in our Qingtian Gang,

170
00:10:02,420 --> 00:10:04,350
and they even got my father killed.

171
00:10:04,940 --> 00:10:06,140
You brat.

172
00:10:06,460 --> 00:10:08,660
I don't have time to play games with you.

173
00:10:08,780 --> 00:10:09,620
As for the ledger,

174
00:10:09,620 --> 00:10:10,580
just you wait.

175
00:10:11,660 --> 00:10:12,540
Let's go.

176
00:10:13,180 --> 00:10:15,580
I've planted explosives all over the yard.

177
00:10:15,740 --> 00:10:17,780
Take one step out that door,

178
00:10:19,220 --> 00:10:20,020
and...

179
00:10:20,020 --> 00:10:20,820
Boom!

180
00:10:21,300 --> 00:10:22,830
Who are you trying to scare?

181
00:10:36,420 --> 00:10:38,500
Qinglong, Zhuque.

182
00:10:39,530 --> 00:10:40,470
Tell me.

183
00:10:40,980 --> 00:10:42,020
Who was it?

184
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:43,510
Damn it.

185
00:10:43,980 --> 00:10:45,440
Why don't you suspect him?

186
00:10:45,820 --> 00:10:46,700
Xuanwu.

187
00:10:46,700 --> 00:10:47,940
Stop pretending.

188
00:10:48,140 --> 00:10:49,180
If you ask me,

189
00:10:49,260 --> 00:10:50,140
it's you.

190
00:10:52,860 --> 00:10:53,740
Is that so?

191
00:10:54,420 --> 00:10:55,300
Young Master.

192
00:10:55,300 --> 00:10:56,980
What exactly do you want to do?

193
00:10:56,980 --> 00:10:58,340
Isn't it obvious?

194
00:10:58,980 --> 00:11:00,580
Shut the door and catch the dog!

195
00:11:00,580 --> 00:11:01,380
Yes.

196
00:11:05,270 --> 00:11:06,670
I'll take you down first!

197
00:11:08,500 --> 00:11:09,900
Shen Tianbai.

198
00:11:14,180 --> 00:11:15,440
You spineless coward!

199
00:11:15,900 --> 00:11:18,100
You can even forget the man
who killed your father?

200
00:11:18,100 --> 00:11:21,300
I can't believe the old chief
had a coward like you for a son.

201
00:11:21,300 --> 00:11:22,660
Young Chief?

202
00:11:22,660 --> 00:11:23,580
Bah!

203
00:11:24,220 --> 00:11:25,180
Qinglong.

204
00:11:25,180 --> 00:11:26,420
Don't rush.

205
00:11:26,980 --> 00:11:28,710
Officer Shen has too much pride

206
00:11:28,780 --> 00:11:30,740
to take credit for something he didn't do.

207
00:11:30,740 --> 00:11:32,780
If he's so sure he didn't kill him,

208
00:11:33,500 --> 00:11:36,020
then I should at least give him
a chance to explain.

209
00:11:36,020 --> 00:11:36,820
But

210
00:11:37,260 --> 00:11:38,860
if he can't explain himself,

211
00:11:39,220 --> 00:11:40,580
I will kill him myself.

212
00:11:41,780 --> 00:11:42,820
Officer Shen,

213
00:11:42,820 --> 00:11:43,780
any objections?

214
00:11:46,140 --> 00:11:47,940
I have evidence left by the mole.

215
00:11:49,540 --> 00:11:50,860
The police got word

216
00:11:50,980 --> 00:11:52,380
that after Lu Wenbiao died,

217
00:11:52,380 --> 00:11:54,180
someone picked up the Qingtian Gang's

218
00:11:54,180 --> 00:11:56,780
most valuable shipment
from the north branch.

219
00:11:56,860 --> 00:11:59,120
They even signed the warehouse logbook.

220
00:11:59,420 --> 00:12:01,140
If we check them one by one,

221
00:12:01,460 --> 00:12:05,180
we will find out whose men they are.

222
00:12:05,820 --> 00:12:06,620
Young Master.

223
00:12:07,220 --> 00:12:08,220
It wasn't me.

224
00:12:08,860 --> 00:12:10,580
I swear on my life.

225
00:12:12,500 --> 00:12:13,660
Then it must be you.

226
00:12:14,660 --> 00:12:15,540
Qinglong.

227
00:12:18,060 --> 00:12:19,900
I had the goods taken.

228
00:12:20,380 --> 00:12:23,020
Did some brainless idiot sign for it?

229
00:12:23,380 --> 00:12:27,020
Those idiots working for Biao really
would do something that stupid.

230
00:12:27,020 --> 00:12:27,820
No.

231
00:12:28,020 --> 00:12:29,660
What if they are bluffing me?

232
00:12:32,220 --> 00:12:33,500
Bullshit.

233
00:12:34,070 --> 00:12:35,370
Trying to frame me?

234
00:12:35,660 --> 00:12:36,920
Where is the evidence?

235
00:12:46,700 --> 00:12:49,700
Page 27, second row, fifth column.

236
00:12:54,260 --> 00:12:55,110
Come on.

237
00:12:55,420 --> 00:12:57,820
I'll give you one last chance
to come clean.

238
00:12:57,980 --> 00:12:58,910
Once you open it,

239
00:12:59,540 --> 00:13:01,100
there's no turning back.
